{
  "id": 8820824670433,
  "title": "Settle 2-Seater Sofa",
  "handle": "muuto-settle-2-seater-sofa",
  "body_html": "<p>Experience outdoor comfort like never before with Muuto's Settle Outdoor 2-Seater Sofa. Designed for all-day relaxation, its lightweight steel frame exudes elegance, featuring visible belts and fine detailing that create visual interest from every angle. FSC\u2122-certified sapele mahogany armrests add warmth and texture, doubling as convenient side tables.</p>\n<p>Crafted for durability, the galvanized, primed, and powder-coated steel frame resists corrosion, ensuring longevity in any weather. Quick-dry foam cushions, upholstered in robust outdoor textiles, provide fast-drying comfort and year-round resilience when paired with a protective cover.</p>\n<p>Inspired by the minimalist mastery of Scandinavian design from the 1950s and 60s, Norwegian duo Anderssen &amp; Voll skillfully played with intersecting metal tubes to create a supportive frame that appears both airy and structured. The Settle Outdoor Sofa seamlessly combines form and function, elevating any outdoor space with its timeless design.</p>\n<p><strong>Also Available</strong>: <a title=\"Settle 3-Seater Sofa\" href=\"https://www.battenhome.co/products/muuto-settle-3-seater-sofa\">Settle 3-Seater Sofa</a>, <a title=\"Settle Lounge Chair\" href=\"https://www.battenhome.co/products/muuto-settle-lounge-chair\">Settle Lounge Chair</a></p>\n<p><strong>Dimensions</strong>: <meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>28.74</span><span>\"H x <meta charset=\"utf-8\">60.04\"W x <meta charset=\"utf-8\">33.07\"D <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\u2502 Seat Height: <meta charset=\"utf-8\">17.32\"</span></p>",
